      "message": "isDbusAbsentError() is a deny list, so every other error counts as transient,\nincluding permanent ones such as AccessDenied, UnknownMethod or NotSupported.\nThose would be retried for the full 120 s before the error is reported.\n\nWould it be safer to allow-list the transient cases (NoReply, Timeout,\nServiceUnknown, NameHasNoOwner, LimitsExceeded) and fail fast on everything\nelse?",
      "revId": "fb172ce403ab67332aba2dbe3d7e5dd00749a6ca",
